  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "The query combines a nitroimidazole core (misonidazole: 89–100% F) with a benzylamide motif (lacosamide: ~100% F); all relevant analogues show high oral bioavailability, and the physicochemical prior is favorable. Therefore F ≥ 20% is strongly supported.",
